{%- comment -%}
  WANELO Product HTML Section
  -----------------------------------------------------------
  Renders the per-product HTML metafield with the shared CSS framework
  (wanelo-product.css) and reveal JS (wanelo-product.js) loaded once
  from theme assets. Per-product palette comes inline via
  <style>:root{...}</style> embedded in the metafield value.

  JSON-LD schemas (Product, FAQ, HowTo, VideoObject) are embedded in the
  metafield content itself — generated by the pipeline, preserved by the
  metafield-prep regex (only application/ld+json scripts pass through;
  executable scripts are stripped). The Shopify theme typically emits a
  default Product schema on the same page; that's expected — our schema
  carries richer data (FAQ/HowTo extracted from content) and Google
  merges multiple Product schemas correctly.

  This section emits NO schema of its own to avoid description
  duplication between body_html and the metafield content.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if product.metafields.custom.html_description != blank -%}

  {{ 'wanelo-product.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

  <div class="product-html-description">
    {{ product.metafields.custom.html_description }}
  </div>

  {{ 'wanelo-product.js' | asset_url | script_tag }}

{%- endif -%}
